      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CITY OF TEARS (2) went so much better at Coffs Harbour. She sat just off the pace and rounded them up quickly. This race wouldn't be that much tougher and the claim is a bonus. Does appear like she has been looking for the journey. WARRIOR BAE (1) never ever runs you a bad race. He is never beaten far when he goes under. He just needs to be close enough in the run but does like it here. GOLD PUMA (6) is another who gets on well with Lismore. They may push forward this time. LOLITA (5) has had a nice campaign. They keep mixing her distances and she still runs well. MASTER ARTIST (4) did run nicely when resuming at Casino. His best form has come when there is sting out of the surface so monitor that.",
